t.py&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Reconnect: re-send buffered deliveries, then cached replay&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="635" y="1194" width="610" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-62" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="69056-60" target="69056-61"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-63" value="&lt;b&gt;document_feature_response&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;featureType ∈ document_assessments, workspace_metadata, strategy_objective, analysis_report, list_of_dates, applicable_laws, procedural_timeline. Always through _emit_document_feature; carries metadata (price, totalPrice)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="150" width="550" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-64" value="&lt;b&gt;workspace:refresh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Arms frontend panel loaders (featureTypes). Every armed loader must be cleared by a matching document_feature_response&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="252" width="550" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-65" value="&lt;b&gt;ai_response&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Chat reply with verified citations and usage metadata&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="324" width="550" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-66" value="&lt;b&gt;probing_prompts_response&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Suggestion chips&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="396" width="550" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-67" value="&lt;b&gt;applicable_law_relevance_response&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Relevance explanation&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="468" width="550" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-68" value="&lt;b&gt;case_law_document_response&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Judgment summary&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="540" width="550" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-69" value="&lt;b&gt;analysis_docx_generate_response&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;DOCX export result&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="612" width="550" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-70" value="&lt;b&gt;template_blueprint_proposal, request_template_sync&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Drafting template blueprints; ask the backend to re-sync templates&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="684" width="550" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-71" value="&lt;b&gt;ai_heartbeat_pong&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Heartbeat reply&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="756" width="550" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-72" value="&lt;b&gt;subscribe / unsubscribe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Workspace room membership&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="828" width="550" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-73" value="&lt;b&gt;Delivery rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• SocketClient.emit returns False when a payload was dropped; _emit_document_feature then buffers it per (workspace, featureType) and re-sends on reconnect before the cached replay.&lt;br&gt;• Under an older run epoch (after a stop) emits are suppressed by _StopFencedSocket.&lt;br&gt;• Re-sends of the same requestId are expected for reload, resume, stop, purge and missing-info edits, and are swallowed.&lt;br&gt;• Schemas: app/socket/schemas.py; full narrative: docs/SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="920" width="550" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-74" value="&lt;b&gt;Key&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1284" width="60" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-75" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Inbound event / trigger&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="1280" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-76" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Processing step&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="258" y="1280" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-77" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Control / guard&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="1280" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-78" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Output / emit&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="594" y="1280" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-79" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Component&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="762" y="1280" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-80" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Optional&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="1280" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-81" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Data store&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=5;fontSize=11;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1098" y="1280" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-82" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;External system&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#8C8496;strokeColor=#736782;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1266" y="1280" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-83" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Rule / note&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1434" y="1280" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="69056-84" value="SimplerToday AI service · C4 model notation · reflects branch feature/SIM-9-claude-structure at commit 7940542 (2026-10-14) · source of truth: CLAUDE.md and docs/architecture.md · page: 4. Socket event catalogue" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1326" width="1840" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="1068657799" name="5. Evidence ingestion"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1950" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="657799-1" value="5 · Evidence ingestion pipeline (DocumentProcessor.process_document, per file in process_batch)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="16" width="1890" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-2" value="Triggered by workspace_created, workspace_sync, workspace_version_restore and document_reload_request. Blocking work (OCR, rendering) runs in worker threads so the socket heartbeat survives." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="52" width="1890" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-3" value="&lt;b&gt;1 · Trigger&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;evidenceFiles in the event payload (backend document id, extension, signed URL)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="130" width="220" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-4" value="&lt;b&gt;2 · Download&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;HTTPS from the signed URL; scheme validated; up to 5 attempts; URL never logged (safe_url)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="130" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-5" value="&lt;b&gt;3 · Route&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;By extension (filename_for_extraction), then content sniffing. Legacy .xls / .ppt rejected explicitly" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="130" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-3" target="657799-4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-4" target="657799-5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-8" value="4 · Extract (app/processing/)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="260" width="1100" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-9" value="&lt;b&gt;PDF&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Text layer + boilerplate strip; --- Page N --- markers. Image-only pages → OCR" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="300" width="250" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-10" value="&lt;b&gt;Scanned PDF / image OCR&lt;/b&gt; (ocr.py)&lt;br&gt;Native JPEG or 200 DPI render; document_text_detection → text_detection; reading order from word boxes; 4 pages in parallel" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="300" width="250" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-11" value="&lt;b&gt;Spreadsheet (.xlsx / .xlsm)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Parsed once into a typed TableSet (row numbers, headers, totals); workbook summary first" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="300" width="250" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-12" value="&lt;b&gt;Audio&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Speech-to-Text V2 Chirp 3 BatchRecognize via GCS, speaker diarization, Gemini re-diarization; [MM:SS] Speaker lines" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="300" width="250" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-13" value="&lt;b&gt;DOCX / PPTX / .doc&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;python-docx, python-pptx, antiword fallback" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="430" width="520" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-14" value="&lt;b&gt;Vision&lt;/b&gt; (Google Cloud): OCR units metered once inside FileProcessor.extract_text_from_image.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Speech&lt;/b&gt;: sttSeconds metered; needs ffmpeg and GCS_BUCKET_NAME for full diarization." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="430" width="520" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-15" value="By file type" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.586;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-5" target="657799-8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-16" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-9" target="657799-10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-17" value="&lt;b&gt;5 · Readability score&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unreadable text replaced by a low-content marker; sheets get apply_lossless_floor" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="300" width="240" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-18" value="&lt;b&gt;6 · PII redaction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;scan_text on prose; redact_tableset per column (never scan_text over rendered tables)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="300" width="240" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-19" value="&lt;b&gt;7 · Classify and extract&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;classify_and_extract over the first 6,000 characters: document type and metadata" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="450" width="240" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-20" value="&lt;b&gt;8 · Chunk&lt;/b&gt; (rag/chunker.py)&lt;br&gt;Structure-aware, ~1,800 chars, 15% overlap (none for sheets); page_start/end, offsets, heading, row ranges" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="450" width="240" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-21" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.32;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-8" target="657799-17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-22" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-17" target="657799-18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-23" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-18" target="657799-19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-24" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-19" target="657799-20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-25" value="&lt;b&gt;9 · Embed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;RETRIEVAL_DOCUMENT, explicit dimension; never padded or zero-filled; failures flagged embedding_failed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="620" width="240" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-26" value="&lt;b&gt;Qdrant&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;[_evidence_v1 / _tables_v1]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;add_document_chunks replaces a document's chunks; rows via replace_document_tables&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fontSize=11;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1470" y="610" width="220" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-27" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-20" target="657799-25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-28" value="upsert" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-25" target="657799-26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-29" value="&lt;b&gt;10 · Manifest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;_merge_document_assessments (never overwrite); _forget_removed_documents clears the removed-evidence ledger" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="620" width="260" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-30" value="&lt;b&gt;11 · Knowledge graph (optional)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ONTOLOGY_INGEST_ENABLED: schedule_document_ingest extracts facts with chunk_id + page; old facts withdrawn first; spreadsheet chunks skipped" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="620" width="260" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-31" value="&lt;b&gt;12 · Emit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;document_feature_response (document_assessments): summary, strength, readability; audio adds transcript + transcriptStatus" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="620" width="260" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-32" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-25" target="657799-29"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-33" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 4;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-29" target="657799-30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-34" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 4;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-30" target="657799-31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-35" value="&lt;b&gt;Neo4j&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;[optional]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Ontology facts&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="780" width="220" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-36" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 4;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="657799-30" target="657799-35"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-37" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules that keep ingestion correct&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Write chunks only through add_document_chunks; delete only through delete_documents / delete_workspace (evidence + tables + graph).&lt;br&gt;• A document keeps its backend id; an id-less reload is abandoned, never invented.&lt;br&gt;• Removing a document: _prune_document_assessments snapshots it into the REMOVED_DOCUMENTS ledger so it shows as a missingInfo gap.&lt;br&gt;• Legacy workspaces are re-indexed on first use (ensure_workspace_indexed) or with scripts/reindex_chunks.py.&lt;br&gt;• Coverage: tests/test_ocr.py, test_tables.py, test_office_extraction.py, tests/offline/verify_ingestion.py." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="780" width="520" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-38" value="&lt;b&gt;After ingestion&lt;/b&gt;, the feature suite runs (page 6): document_assessments → workspace_metadata → strategy_objective → analysis_report → list_of_dates → applicable_laws → procedural_timeline." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="780" width="820" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-39" value="&lt;b&gt;Key&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1024" width="60" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-40" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Inbound event / trigger&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="1020" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-41" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Processing step&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="258" y="1020" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-42" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Control / guard&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="1020" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-43" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Output / emit&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="594" y="1020" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-44" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Component&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="762" y="1020" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-45" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Optional&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="1020" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-46" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Data store&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=5;fontSize=11;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1098" y="1020" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-47" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;External system&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#8C8496;strokeColor=#736782;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1266" y="1020" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-48" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Rule / note&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1434" y="1020" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="657799-49" value="SimplerToday AI service · C4 model notation · reflects branch feature/SIM-9-claude-structure at commit 7940542 (2026-10-14) · source of truth: CLAUDE.md and docs/architecture.md · page: 5. Evidence ingestion" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1066" width="1890" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="3467365334" name="6. Panel generation and delivery"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1950" pageHeight="1180" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="365334-1" value="6 · Panel generation, delivery and run control" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="16" width="1890" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-2" value="How a panel is produced and how it reliably reaches the frontend, including stop / resume and reconnect." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="52" width="1890" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-3" value="&lt;b&gt;Role gate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;initialize_workspace_with_role first; a role change invalidates all derived intelligence" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="130" width="240" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-4" value="&lt;b&gt;workspace:refresh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Arms one loader per declared featureType (e.g. OBJECTIVE_CHANGE_REFRESH_FEATURES)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="130" width="260" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-3" target="365334-4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-6" value="Feature suite in product order (handlers/workspace_events.py); long work = asyncio tasks registered via _track_background_task" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="280" width="1450" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-7" value="&lt;b&gt;document_assessments&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="330" width="185" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-8" value="&lt;b&gt;workspace_metadata&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="265" y="330" width="185" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-9" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-7" target="365334-8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-10" value="&lt;b&gt;strategy_objective&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="330" width="185" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-11" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-8" target="365334-10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-12" value="&lt;b&gt;analysis_report&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="675" y="330" width="185" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-13" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-10" target="365334-12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-14" value="&lt;b&gt;list_of_dates&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="330" width="185" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-15" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-12" target="365334-14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-16" value="&lt;b&gt;applicable_laws&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1085" y="330" width="185" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-17" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-14" target="365334-16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-18" value="&lt;b&gt;procedural_timeline&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="330" width="185" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-19" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-16" target="365334-18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-20" value="&lt;b&gt;Context build&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;get_all_documents (reading order + metadata) → fit_to_budget (PANEL_CONTEXT_CHARS, 200K): opening, closing and relevant middle, every cut marked" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="520" width="270" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-21" value="&lt;b&gt;Ground truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;_build_document_inventory: manifest of present documents + REMOVED EVIDENCE block; objective from the strategy cache" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="520" width="270" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-22" value="&lt;b&gt;Graph evidence [G#]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;strategy, analysis, list_of_dates, applicable_laws only; augment mode; enabled per panel after eval" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="520" width="250" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-23" value="&lt;b&gt;Model call&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;gemini_client.generate → router (page 8). Result checked with is_generation_error(); CancelledError caught, logged, re-raised" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="520" width="260" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-24" value="&lt;b&gt;Normalise&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Applicable laws: drop IPC rows, cap 12, law_N ids, annotate_law_rows (register status, sectionTitle); missingInfo gaps for removed documents" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="520" width="280" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-25" value="Then runs" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.283;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-4" target="365334-6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-26" value="For each panel" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;exitX=0.093;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-6" target="365334-20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-27" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-20" target="365334-21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-28" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 4;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-21" target="365334-22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-29" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 4;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-22" target="365334-23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-30" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-23" target="365334-24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-31" value="&lt;b&gt;_emit_document_feature&lt;/b&gt; (single chokepoint)&lt;br&gt;Panel citations by rag/attribution (quote copied from the stored passage, page where it is); usage metadata via drain_for_emit; one result log line" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="710" width="280" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-32" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-24" target="365334-31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-33" value="&lt;b&gt;Stop fence&lt;/b&gt; (_StopFencedSocket)&lt;br&gt;Emits from an older run epoch are suppressed and return False. Stop bumps the epoch; new runs capture the new epoch" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="710" width="290" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-34" value="&lt;b&gt;SocketClient.emit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;[returns bool]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;True = delivered; never raises&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="710" width="280" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-35" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-31" target="365334-33"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-36" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-33" target="365334-34"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-37" value="&lt;b&gt;Backend → web app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;[document_feature_response]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Clears the matching loader&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#8C8496;strokeColor=#736782;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="710" width="280" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-38" value="delivered" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-34" target="365334-37"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-39" value="&lt;b&gt;Pending delivery buffer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;[CacheKinds.PENDING_FEATURE_DELIVERY]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Per (workspace, featureType), in memory and persisted&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fontSize=11;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="930" width="280" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-40" value="&lt;b&gt;Payload caches&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;[per feature, keyed by workspace]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;_workspace_strategy_payload, _analysis_, _applicable_laws_, _procedural_timeline_ …&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fontSize=11;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="930" width="290" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-41" value="False → buffer" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#B85450;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-34" target="365334-39"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-42" value="Caches result" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-31" target="365334-40"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1350" y="895"/><mxPoint x="1045" y="895"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-43" value="&lt;b&gt;On reconnect&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. re-send buffered envelopes&lt;br&gt;2. replay cached payloads&lt;br&gt;Held objective changes are never auto-resumed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="930" width="280" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-44" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="365334-39" target="365334-43"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-45" value="&lt;b&gt;A lit loader must always be paired with a terminal emit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Every exit branch that can leave a loader lit calls _release_refresh_loaders and tells the user the change did not land.&lt;br&gt;• Stop: cancels update tasks (never a chat turn), drops buffered deliveries, disarms recovery markers; stale stoppedAt ignored.&lt;br&gt;• Resume: workspace:refresh declaring exactly reEmitFeatures, then one response per feature in product order, nothing else.&lt;br&gt;• Coverage: verify_run_control.py, verify_objective_change.py." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="910" width="660" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-46" value="&lt;b&gt;Objective change&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;_regenerate_strategy_for_new_objective re-frames the case and report summaries in one call. Deterministic checks keep facts: every figure survives, no new proper nouns, opening intact; otherwise the previous text stands. The new objective always lands. The quality-score explanation is regenerated against the new objective.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Two strategy paths&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Production = _generate_strategies_from_documents; strategy_agent.py is programmatic only." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1540" y="130" width="360" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-47" value="&lt;b&gt;Key&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1104" width="60" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-48" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Inbound event / trigger&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="1100" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-49" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Processing step&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="258" y="1100" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-50" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Control / guard&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="1100" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-51" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Output / emit&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="594" y="1100" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-52" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Component&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="762" y="1100" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-53" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Optional&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="1100" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-54" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Data store&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=5;fontSize=11;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1098" y="1100" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-55" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;External system&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#8C8496;strokeColor=#736782;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1266" y="1100" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-56" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Rule / note&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1434" y="1100" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="365334-57" value="SimplerToday AI service · C4 model notation · reflects branch feature/SIM-9-claude-structure at commit 7940542 (2026-10-14) · source of truth: CLAUDE.md and docs/architecture.md · page: 6. Panel generation and delivery" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1146" width="1890" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="931777865" name="7. Governed chat and citations"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1050" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="777865-1" value="7 · Governed chat and citations (user_message_request → ai_response)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="16" width="1840" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-2" value="Chat replies are neutral and accuracy-first. Nothing is cited that was not checked against a stored passage." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="52" width="1840" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-3" value="&lt;b&gt;user_message_request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;chatType, message, optional attachment, optional askedBy (non-owner)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="130" width="250" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-4" value="&lt;b&gt;resolve_asker&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Owner or edit → mutations allowed. view or unknown asker with a known roster → read-only (reply says so)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="130" width="260" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-3" target="777865-4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-6" value="&lt;b&gt;ChatContext&lt;/b&gt; (chat_models.py)&lt;br&gt;Role, objective, panels, attachment text, WHO IS ASKING block (access level changes nothing in the analysis)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="130" width="300" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-4" target="777865-6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-8" value="Evidence pack (app/rag/chat_context.py)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="110" width="900" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-9" value="&lt;b&gt;Small workspace&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Documents go in whole" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990" y="150" width="270" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-10" value="&lt;b&gt;Large workspace&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Query rewrite → hybrid search (dense RETRIEVAL_QUERY + sparse) → rerank → retry when nothing relevant" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1280" y="150" width="280" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-11" value="&lt;b&gt;Labels&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[E#] document passages, [C#] case laws, [S#] statutes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1580" y="150" width="270" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-12" value="&lt;b&gt;Spreadsheet questions&lt;/b&gt; (rag/table_query.py)&lt;br&gt;Model writes a JSON spec; code validates against real columns and computes over every row with exact decimals → [T#]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990" y="280" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-13" value="&lt;b&gt;Graph facts&lt;/b&gt; (optional, augment)&lt;br&gt;Lines ending in the [E#] label of their source passage, so they are checked like any claim" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1430" y="280" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-14" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-6" target="777865-9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-15" value="Intelligence chat graph (app/langgraph/intelligence_chat_agent.py)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="450" width="1830" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-16" value="&lt;b&gt;context_builder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Assemble prompt context&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="500" width="270" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-17" value="&lt;b&gt;intent_classifier&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Classify the request&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="500" width="270" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-18" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-16" target="777865-17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-19" value="&lt;b&gt;explain_why&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Model call via router&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="500" width="270" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-20" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-17" target="777865-19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-21" value="&lt;b&gt;action_dispatcher&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Records which agent should act; never invokes in-line&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="500" width="270" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-22" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-19" target="777865-21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-23" value="&lt;b&gt;response_formatter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Shape the reply&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="500" width="270" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-24" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-21" target="777865-23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-25" value="&lt;b&gt;governance_validator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Neutrality and accuracy checks; confidence&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="500" width="270" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-26" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-23" target="777865-25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-27" value="evidence" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-12" target="777865-16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-28" value="&lt;b&gt;verify_and_number&lt;/b&gt; (rag/citations.py)&lt;br&gt;Remove invented labels; check every figure in a cited sentence against the cited passage; re-point if elsewhere; report figures found nowhere; renumber [1], [2]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="700" width="370" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-29" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-25" target="777865-28"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-30" value="&lt;b&gt;One repair pass&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A figure still unsupported is flagged inline and governance drops confidence to LOW" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="700" width="380" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-31" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-28" target="777865-30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-32" value="&lt;b&gt;ai_response&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reply text + citations whose marker is still in the text + usage metadata; result log line (chars, citations)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="700" width="380" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-33" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-30" target="777865-32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-34" value="&lt;b&gt;Chat-driven mutations&lt;/b&gt; (only when mutations_allowed)&lt;br&gt;Panel edits, fact corrections, objective-change cascade, AI-marker panel updates, role selection, drafting assistant. A read-only asker gets the same analysis, and the reply says the change was not made." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="700" width="580" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-35" value="Gates mutations" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;dashed=1;exitX=0.06;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.527;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="777865-4" target="777865-34"><mxGeometry x="-0.75" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-36" value="&lt;b&gt;Coverage&lt;/b&gt;: tests/offline/verify_rag.py (needs local Qdrant), verify_fact_corrections.py, verify_workspace_share.py, verify_objective_change.py. &lt;b&gt;Measure&lt;/b&gt; retrieval and citation quality with scripts/eval_rag.py over a golden set (recall@k, MRR, citation precision / coverage, unsupported rate)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="890" width="1830" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-37" value="&lt;b&gt;Key&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="974" width="60" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-38" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Inbound event / trigger&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="970" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-39" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Processing step&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="258" y="970" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-40" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Control / guard&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="970" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-41" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Output / emit&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="594" y="970" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-42" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Component&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="762" y="970" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-43" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Optional&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="970" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-44" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Data store&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=5;fontSize=11;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1098" y="970" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-45" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;External system&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#8C8496;strokeColor=#736782;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1266" y="970" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-46" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Rule / note&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1434" y="970" width="158" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="777865-47" value="SimplerToday AI service · C4 model notation · reflects branch feature/SIM-9-claude-structure at commit 7940542 (2026-10-14) · source of truth: CLAUDE.md and docs/architecture.md · page: 7. Governed chat and citations" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1016" width="1840" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="2685851364" name="8. Model routing, governance and cost"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="851364-1" value="8 · Model routing, governance (gate0) and cost tracking" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="16" width="1840" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-2" value="gemini_client keeps its name but is a facade over app/llm/. Provider SDKs may only be imported in app/llm/providers/ (tests/test_llm_router.py fails the build otherwise)." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="52" width="1840" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-3" value="&lt;b&gt;Callers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;[handlers, agents, RAG, audio re-diarization]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;@meter_usage label = route key (feature= on the llm_call line); explicit task= for stable keys&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="280" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-4" value="&lt;b&gt;gemini_client&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;[ai/gemini_client.py]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;generate / generate_sync (worker threads run on the main loop, caller's context)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="140" width="260" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-5" value="&lt;b&gt;ModelRouter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;[llm/router.py]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Chain: user's aiModel (only LLM_SELECTABLE_MODELS) → LLM_ROUTES per task → default. Timeout (default 300s), retry, fallback, JSON repair, one llm_call log line, usage recording. A blocked result is final: never re-routed&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="120" width="400" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-6" value="&lt;b&gt;GATE0_ENFORCE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Startup refuses any direct-provider profile; every call goes through gate0. Grounding and embeddings never follow the user's choice" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="140" width="300" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="851364-3" target="851364-4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="851364-4" target="851364-5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="851364-5" target="851364-6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-10" value="Provider adapters (llm/providers/): translate only, no policy" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="350" width="1360" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-11" value="&lt;b&gt;gemini&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;google-genai&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="400" width="150" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-12" value="&lt;b&gt;openai&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;OpenAI&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="225" y="400" width="150" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-13" value="&lt;b&gt;azure_openai&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Azure OpenAI&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="390" y="400" width="150" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-14" value="&lt;b&gt;azure_foundry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Azure AI Foundry&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="555" y="400" width="150" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-15" value="&lt;b&gt;openai_compat&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;DeepSeek, Qwen, Llama, vLLM …&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="400" width="150" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-16" value="&lt;b&gt;bedrock&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;AWS Bedrock&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="885" y="400" width="150" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-17" value="&lt;b&gt;sagemaker&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;AWS SageMaker&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="400" width="150" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="851364-18" value="&lt;b&gt;gate0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;LiteLLM gateway&lt;/font&gt;" style="round